      "text": "CORE SERVICE — THE BRAIN\nFastify on 127.0.0.1:48750\n\n• REST /api/v1 — UI commands\n• WebSocket /ws — live events out\n• MCP /mcp — the agents' toolbox\n\nschedules cron, runs pipelines,\nspawns & supervises every agent run",
